10:Ta7a,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』ジョ伝 三つら星刀語り","description":"「序伝（過去）」と「如伝（現在）」の二部構成で描かれる、初期の本丸の物語。黒田官兵衛・長政親子に縁のある刀や、まだ本丸が大きくなる前の山姥切国広の苦悩と成長を描く。 西暦2205年、歴史修正主義者との戦いの中、まだ練度の低かった初期の本丸。山姥切国広率いる第一部隊は、調査任務で訪れた《小田原征伐》の時代で、予期せぬ時間遡行軍の奇襲に遭い、戦国軍師・黒田官兵衛らと接触する。それから幾年月、強く成長した山姥切たちは再び因縁の地・小田原へと出陣。そこで彼らは、過去の自分たちと交差する不可解な事象に直面することとなる。緻密に張り巡らされた伏線が回収される中、山姥切は敗北の記憶を抱えた過去の己と向き合い、真の近侍へと歩みを進めるための《過去を乗り越える戦い》に挑む。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-joden","keywords":"刺さる/しんどい, 群像のうまみ, 世界観つよめ, 演出強め","about":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"和田 雅成","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/wada-masanari"},{"@type":"Person","name":"納谷 健","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/naya-takeru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"北川 尚弥","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kitagawa-naoya"},{"@type":"Person","name":"武子 直輝","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/takeshi-naoki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"横山 真史","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/yokoyama-masafumi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"成松 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/narimatsu-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"木津 つばさ","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kizu-tsubasa"},{"@type":"Person","name":"飯山 裕太","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/iiyama-yuta"},{"@type":"Person","name":"山浦 徹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/yamaura-toru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"伊阪 達也","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/isaka-tatsuya"},{"@type":"Person","name":"川下 大洋","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kawashita-taiyo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"日南田 顕久","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/hinata-akihisa"},{"@type":"Person","name":"松川 真也","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/matsukawa-shinya"}]}5:["$","main",null,{"className":"container","style":{"paddingBlock":32},"children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}],["$","